{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7486","chapterId":"s5c3e2275ed29d879","language":"zh-CN","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7486-a00e83b3b6c58b864a9d","text":"感觉[开拓者]乘客好久没有回列车了……","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-47cbb64e417d1a150b4b","text":"我们不是刚分开？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-f6d771a1b0b41f77bd33","text":"距离我们上一次说再见好像没有过去很久吧？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-f76ee472c00de693669c","text":"不要在意这些细节帕！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-900ced72311a22d8dae2","text":"好像的确蛮久了…","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-7c42c01b3e7b155a4e96","text":"唔…确实感觉过了挺久，都有点忘记帕姆长什么样子了","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7486-88c9f274e982f7f09eb6","text":"倒也没有那么久帕！","speaker":"帕姆"},{"id":"other-message-p7486-aa999812e1d1304a7b18","text":"有时间还是回来一趟帕，我有一些东西要给你","speaker":"帕姆"}]}
